+/**
+ * qemu_crucible_hot_fork_capture_parent_identity() - pin the fork parent
+ * @identity: caller-owned identity storage
+ *
+ * Opens an exact Linux pidfd for the calling process before a later fork.
+ * The resulting value is inherited by the child and must not be copied into
+ * an unrelated process or altered by the caller.
+ *
+ * Returns zero on success or a negative errno-style status on failure.
